{"version":1,"content":"<p>追求刺激的朋友，越南芽莊有樂園引入全新過山車，軌道會向前傾斜至90度再直線俯衝，帶來極速快感！</p><p>同市亦有集多功能於一身的高空酒吧、坐擁無邊際泳池的新酒店，還有米芝蓮推介名店的姊妹店進駐，無論吃喝玩樂都相當盡興！</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;-----</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:23:45.769759+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T09:00:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T09:17:13.026242+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:17:13.026242+00:00","content_hash":"110fd69f0bcdb1a65173a86f0099f1c41509044baafd507b5982313dc6871edb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}